{
    "title": "Yard Mastery: DIY Lawn Care",
    "description": "Get a step-by-step personalized lawn care plan and recommendations based on your specific soil and geographic location. \u201cWhat to throw down, and when to throw it down\u201d plus a fertilizer calculator, journal to track your progress, and soon to come: in-app lawn segmentation and measuring.\r\n\r\nDIY Lawn Care Schedule\r\nGet a step-by-step personalized lawn care plan and recommendations based on your specific soil and geographic location. \u201cWhat to throw down, and when to throw it down\u201d plus a fertilizer calculator, journal to track your progress, and soon to come: in-app lawn segmentation and measuring.\r\n\r\nSoil Temps, Notifications and Next Steps\r\nSee and track your specific 24-hour average soil temperature. The majority of DIY lawn care strategies are based on soil temperature milestones and our app will display your 24-hour average soil temperature for your specific location.\r\n\r\nYour custom lawn plan will automatically populate on your home screen to show your upcoming steps. \r\n\r\nYou also have the ability to set and see your upcoming reminders such as: time to sharpen your mower blades, take a progress picture or just about anything you can dream of.\r\nEach user receives personalized application recommendations on \u201cwhat to put down\u201d and \u201cwhen to put it down\u201d based on their location, current conditions and previous applications. The applications suggested are custom to each user and dynamically adjust through the season.\r\n\r\nPersonalized Lawn Journal\r\nYou get a custom lawn journal where you can track your lawn tasks along with when and what products you applied. Whether you applied to your front yard, back yard, side yard or boulevard you can track each independently.\r\n\r\nWithin the Lawn Journal you can also upload photos to track the before and after progress and set reminders for yourself so you don\u2019t miss upcoming tasks.\r\n\r\nApplication Recommendations\r\nEach user receives personalized application recommendations on \u201cwhat to put down\u201d and \u201cwhen to put it down\u201d based on their location, current conditions and previous applications. The applications suggested are custom to each user and dynamically adjust through the season.",
